        "liquid": "<style>\n  .lok-comparatif {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    padding: 24px 0;\n    font-family: sans-serif;\n  }\n  .lok-comparatif__inner {\n    max-width: 100%;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;\n    gap: 40px;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 0 20px;\n  }\n  .lok-comparatif__left {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 20px;\n  }\n  .lok-comparatif__title {\n    color: #0D1B4B;\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 4px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .lok-comparatif__subtitle {\n    color: #4A5568;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin: 0 0 16px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .lok-comparatif__trust {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .lok-comparatif__trust-item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n  .lok-comparatif__trust-icon {\n    width: 36px;\n    height: 36px;\n    min-width: 36px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #EEF4FD;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  .lok-comparatif__trust-text strong {\n    display: block;\n    color: #0D1B4B;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .lok-comparatif__trust-text span {\n    color: #4A5568;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .lok-comparatif__right {\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n  .lok-comparatif__right img {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n    .lok-comparatif__inner {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 24px;\n      padding: 0 10px;\n    }\n    .lok-comparatif__title {\n      font-size: 18px;\n    }\n    .lok-comparatif__right {\n      order: -1;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"lok-comparatif\">\n  <div class=\"lok-comparatif__inner\">\n\n    <div class=\"lok-comparatif__left\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"lok-comparatif__title\">Pourquoi choisir Lokeo ?</h2>\n        <p class=\"lok-comparatif__subtitle\">Lokeo est la seule solution conçue pour rester dans la chaussure de votre enfant — discrète, fiable, et sans contrainte.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"lok-comparatif__trust\">\n        <div class=\"lok-comparatif__trust-item\">\n          <div class=\"lok-comparatif__trust-icon\">👟</div>\n          <div class=\"lok-comparatif__trust-text\">\n            <strong>Caché dans la chaussure</strong>\n            <span>Invisible à l'œil nu. Votre enfant ne sait pas qu'il est localisé.</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"lok-comparatif__trust-item\">\n          <div class=\"lok-comparatif__trust-icon\">🔗</div>\n          <div class=\"lok-comparatif__trust-text\">\n            <strong>Ne se perd pas, ne se retire pas</strong>\n            <span>Contrairement à un bracelet ou un téléphone, il reste en place à chaque pas.</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"lok-comparatif__trust-item\">\n          <div class=\"lok-comparatif__trust-icon\">💳</div>\n          <div class=\"lok-comparatif__trust-text\">\n            <strong>Zéro abonnement</strong>\n            <span>Un seul achat. Aucun frais mensuel, aucune surprise.</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"lok-comparatif__trust-item\">\n          <div class=\"lok-comparatif__trust-icon\">🔋</div>\n          <div class=\"lok-comparatif__trust-text\">\n            <strong>1 an d'autonomie</strong>\n            <span>Pas de recharge quotidienne. Une pile, une année de tranquillité.</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"lok-comparatif__trust-item\">\n          <div class=\"lok-comparatif__trust-icon\">📱</div>\n          <div class=\"lok-comparatif__trust-text\">\n            <strong>Compatible iPhone et Android</strong>\n            <span>Fonctionne avec l'application que vous avez déjà sur votre téléphone.</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"lok-comparatif__right\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0988/3995/3735/files/ChatGPT_Image_2_juil._2026_11_02_20.png?v=1782982967\" alt=\"Comparatif Lokeo vs Bracelet GPS vs Téléphone\">\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>",
